# W2b, b (k2): at the lobby gate while a's instance runs in stag0101; the relay drops b's PLAN, so the held press goes out
# after World:PlanWaitMs (1 s) and the departure runs; b's barrier is held for the loading-screen prompt (a's row), which
# b answers with the first row: b joins a and plays a's story; home by its gate disc on its own story.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own story at home
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b in stag0101
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=0
log b plays a's story
follow 40 until sealed>=3000
log together
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
log b home by the gate disc
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own story again at home
